#  CI/CD Pipeline Setup using Jenkins, Docker, Docker Hub & EC2 Deployment

##  Objective

Set up a Jenkins pipeline that:

1. Pulls code from GitHub
2. Builds Docker images (Frontend & Backend)
3. Pushes images to Docker Hub
4. SSH into EC2 server
5. Pulls latest images
6. Deploys containers using Docker Compose

---

##  Architecture Overview


GitHub Repo 
    ⬇ (Webhook / Poll SCM)
Jenkins Server
    ⬇ Builds Docker Images
Docker Hub Registry 
    ⬆ Push Images
Jenkins → SSH to EC2 
    ⬇ Pull updated images
EC2 Server
     Run containers using docker-compose


