## 🛠 Troubleshooting

| Issue                    | Solution                                          |
| ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------- |
| Permission denied (SSH)  | Use correct username (ec2-user/ubuntu)            |
| CORS blocked             | Enable CORS in backend using `cors()`             |
| Port already in use      | Update docker-compose to use different host ports |
| docker-compose not found | Install with `sudo curl` command                  |
| Old image running        | Use `--force-recreate` in compose                 |

